                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Tried to use custom xsl and noticed that &lt;ivy:report&gt; does not deliver the ivy-report.css as it usually does.<br/>
This code results in ivy-report.css not being delivered:<br/>
&lt;ivy:report todir=&quot;${module.output.subdir}&quot; xml=&quot;true&quot; xslext=&quot;xml&quot; xslfile=&quot;${ivy-common.basedir}/ivy-report-customized.xsl&quot; graph=&quot;false&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; outputpattern=&quot;ivy-report.html&quot; /&gt;<br/>
Results are ivy.xml and ivy-report.html.<br/>
<br/>
This code results in ivy-report.css being delivered (as expected):<br/>
&lt;ivy:report todir=&quot;${module.output.subdir}&quot; graph=&quot;false&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; outputpattern=&quot;ivy-report.html&quot; /&gt;  <br/>
<br/>
Originally noticed 2.0 rc1, verified on 2.0 final
  </td>
