[ivy:resolve] problem occured while resolving dependency: org.jboss.jsfunit#jboss-jsfunit;1.0.0.GA-SNAPSHOT {jsfunit=[default]} with jboss-snapshot: java.lang.IndexOutOfBoundsException: Index: 0, Size: 0<br/>
