                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ivy:resolve ant task does not support &quot;branch&quot;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
