</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      ivy:resolve ant task does not support &quot;branch&quot; attribute, though in standard mode it does, since it reads it from ivy.xml file. <br/>
<br/>
As a side note to that, I think that &#39;revision&#39; attribute should be &#39;rev&#39; instead, to be align with how it is specified in ivy.xml file.
