                <tr id="issuerow12415915" rel="12415915" data-issuekey="IVY-1037" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1037" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1037">IVY-1037</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Buildnumber task does not work for chained resolvers
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Martin Eigenbrodt
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Martin Eigenbrodt
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Mar/09 09:49 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/09 22:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Mar/09 07:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant,                     Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If the resolver attribute of the  buildnumber task point to a chained resolver the buildnumber task will not find any existing revision.<br/>
I will attach a unittest to show the problem.<br/>
I&#39;ve debuged into this point:<br/>
The Buildnubmer task uses SearchEngine.listModules whcih in turn uses<br/>
Resolver.listTokenValues. The Doc says ListTokenValue must not return values for child resolvers. <br/>
So litTokenValues can not  return values for child resolvers either. I don&#39;t know how to fix.
  </td>
