                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In my project setup I am working with maven poms and need to utilize the values of {{finalName}} and {{directory}} in an artifact pattern, but the Ivy PomReader does not take those elements into account.<br/>
In my local installation I patched the code to make use of those elements. From how I understand it, I can only access extra attributes in the {{info}} element in artifact patterns, so that is where the customized code stores those values. Please let me know when there is a better way to handle that use-case in a more ivy-like fashion.<br/>
I will attach my patch as an example.<br/>
<br/>
Information about finalName and directory:<br/>
http://maven.apache.org/pom.html#BaseBuild_Element
  </td>
