                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                The showprogress=false attribute of ivy:resolve doesn&#39;t do what it should
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
