  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      According to this page: http://ant.apache.org/ivy/history/latest-release/use/resolve.html , the &lt;ivy:resolve&gt; task accepts an attribute called &quot;showprogress&quot; that specifies whether during downloads, dots (periods) will be shown.   I my build file, I have:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ivy:resolve showprogress=&quot;false&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
but the dots are still being shown while downloading.
