                <tr id="issuerow12423769" rel="12423769" data-issuekey="IVY-1072" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1072" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1072">IVY-1072</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ResolveReport and ConfigurationResolveReport list different order of modules
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Michael Fraenkel
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Michael Fraenkel
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Apr/09 12:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Apr/09 12:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am trying to enumerate the order of modules in a from most to least.<br/>
<br/>
My ResolveReport has a single ConfigurationResolveReport.<br/>
If I invoke getModuleIds() or any method that returns the dependencies, the order in the ResolveReport is not from most to least but the order in the ConfigurationResolveReport is.<br/>
<br/>
I realize the order within an ivy.xml doesn&#39;t affect this order but that would have been nice too.<br/>
<br/>
We have something like the following:<br/>
<br/>
Root -&gt; E, A, D<br/>
A -&gt; B,C<br/>
B -&gt; E<br/>
C -&gt;<br/>
D -&gt; E<br/>
E -&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The results are<br/>
ResolveReport = E, A, D, B, C<br/>
ConfigurationResolveReport = D, A, C, B, E<br/>
<br/>
The ResolveReport is just listing them in order of definition.  The javadoc says otherwise.<br/>
The ConfigurationResolveReport reports a valid ordering but doesn&#39;t take in to account the order within the XML.  Something like A, D, B, C, E would have been more appropriate.<br/>
<br/>
Is the JavaDoc just wrong?
  </td>
