                <tr id="issuerow12429047" rel="12429047" data-issuekey="IVY-1097" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1097" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1097">IVY-1097</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                configuration groups
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Jun/09 12:42 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Jun/09 22:55 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Jun/09 13:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.0-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In modules having a lot of configurations, sometimes it would be nice to be able to define a group of configurations based on their attributes (including extra attributes). The proposed syntax is {{*[att=value]}}<br/>
<br/>
For instance, one could define an extra attribute named &#39;axis&#39; on the configuration, and then refer to all configurations where &#39;axis&#39; is &#39;platform&#39; with {{*[axis=platform]}}. <br/>
<br/>
Here is an example of Ivy file using this notation:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&quot;1.0&quot; xmlns:e=&quot;http://ant.apache.org/ivy/extra&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;info organisation=&quot;org5&quot;<br/>
	       module=&quot;mod5.1&quot;<br/>
	       revision=&quot;4.5&quot;<br/>
	       status=&quot;integration&quot;<br/>
	       publication=&quot;20090501110000&quot;<br/>
	/&gt;<br/>
	&lt;configurations&gt;<br/>
		&lt;conf name=&quot;A&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;conf name=&quot;B&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		<br/>
		&lt;conf name=&quot;windows&quot; e:axis=&quot;platform&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;conf name=&quot;linux&quot; e:axis=&quot;platform&quot;/&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/configurations&gt;<br/>
	&lt;publications&gt;<br/>
		&lt;artifact name=&quot;art51A&quot; type=&quot;jar&quot; conf=&quot;A,*[axis=platform]&quot;/&gt;<br/>
		&lt;artifact name=&quot;art51B&quot; type=&quot;jar&quot; conf=&quot;B,*[axis=platform]&quot;/&gt;<br/>
		&lt;artifact name=&quot;art51B&quot; type=&quot;dll&quot; conf=&quot;B,windows&quot;/&gt;<br/>
		&lt;artifact name=&quot;art51B&quot; type=&quot;so&quot; conf=&quot;B,linux&quot;/&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/publications&gt;<br/>
	&lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
		&lt;dependency org=&quot;org1&quot; name=&quot;mod1.2&quot; rev=&quot;2.0&quot; conf=&quot;B,*[axis=platform]-&gt;default&quot;/&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
In this ivy file, {{*[axis=platform]}} is equivalent to {{windows,linux}}
  </td>
