                <tr id="issuerow12431652" rel="12431652" data-issuekey="IVY-1106" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1106" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1106">IVY-1106</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                URLResource does not properly support authentication
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Heschi Kreinick
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Heschi Kreinick
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Jul/09 01:11 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 07/May/10 20:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/Jul/09 22:16 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.0-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      org.apache.ivy.plugins.repository.url.UrlResource#openStream uses java.net.URL#openStream rather than going through the URLHandlerRegistry like init does. This breaks authentication support. I encountered this bug when using a version range specification (1.+) against a secured Maven repository, but I imagine that it can cause any number of other problems. The fix is simply to change openStream to work the same way init does, by replacing<br/>
<br/>
return url.openStream();<br/>
<br/>
with <br/>
<br/>
return URLHandlerRegistry.getDefault().openStream(url);<br/>
<br/>
This change passes all tests and solves my problem.
  </td>
