                <tr id="issuerow12434280" rel="12434280" data-issuekey="IVY-1116" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1116" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1116">IVY-1116</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make default resolveId include branch
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Willem Verstraeten
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Willem Verstraeten
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Aug/09 13:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 02/Sep/09 10:41 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.0-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      By default, the resolveId is [org]-[module], but it would make sense to make this [org]-[module]-[branch]. When you use branches, it is very possible that the same ivy module is built for two branches at the same time. With the default resolveId this gives concurrency issues, but if the resolveId would include the branch name by default, these problems would not exist.
  </td>
