                                            <td class="environment">      Ivy 2.1.0-RC2<br/>
Apache Ant version 1.7.0 compiled on December 13 2006 
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Calling <br/>
    String partiallyResolvedPattern = IvyPatternHelper.substituteTokens(pattern, tokenValues);<br/>
<br/>
where <br/>
   pattern = &quot;&lt;sandbox&gt;/test/repositories/IVY-1115/[organisation]/[module](/[att])/ivy-[revision].xml&quot;<br/>
   tokenValues = {revision=1, module=a, organisation=test, branch=trunk, type=ivy, ext=xml}<br/>
<br/>
returns <br/>
  /Project/hudsontools/admin/ivystatus/test/repositories/IVY-1115/test/a/ivy-1.xml<br/>
<br/>
instead of <br/>
  /Project/hudsontools/admin/ivystatus/test/repositories/IVY-1115/test/a(/[att])/ivy-1.xml<br/>
<br/>
Extra attributes are resolved after this partial pattern is resolved so the current behavior will never correctly resolve an optional extra attribute.  See AbstractPatternsBase.resolveTokenValues(...).<br/>

  </td>
