                <tr id="issuerow12443953" rel="12443953" data-issuekey="IVY-1153" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1153" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1153">IVY-1153</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Implement timestamped snapshots
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Burt Leung
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Burt Leung
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Dec/09 23:35 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Dec/09 23:35 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Right now it appears that Ivy does not have the ability to publish timestamped snapshots, which are a common format in Maven repositories. Such a feature would further improve (Ivy) collaboration with Maven repositories.<br/>
<br/>
For example, when I tried to publish a snapshot to a Sonatype Nexus repository I found that the files were placed like so:<br/>
&lt;nexus server root directory&gt;<br/>
    &lt;snapshot repository folder&gt;<br/>
        &lt;artifactName&gt;<br/>
            &lt;versionNumber-SNAPSHOT&gt;<br/>
                &lt;artifactName&gt;-1.0.0-SNAPSHOT.jar<br/>
                &lt;artifactName&gt;-1.0.0-SNAPSHOT.pom<br/>
<br/>
Whereas, artifacts published using Maven are placed according to the following file system structure:<br/>
&lt;nexus server root directory&gt;<br/>
    &lt;snapshot repository folder&gt;<br/>
        &lt;artifactName&gt;<br/>
            &lt;versionNumber-SNAPSHOT&gt;<br/>
                &lt;artifactName&gt;-1.0.0-&lt;timestamp&gt;.jar<br/>
                &lt;artifactName&gt;-1.0.0-&lt;timestamp&gt;.pom
  </td>
