                                            <td class="description">      When using Ivy from Ant, there is a task that allows to install a project from one repository to another (this is most often used to &quot;download&quot; projects from an online repository to an enterprise, shared or local one). This can&#39;t be done when using Ivy in standalone mode: there is no command line option for it. Request that support for this is added. 
