                <tr id="issuerow12455571" rel="12455571" data-issuekey="IVY-1167" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1167" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1167">IVY-1167</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Using SFTP resolver with full pattern URL prevents use of dynamic versions
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Gregory Fernandez
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Gregory Fernandez
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Feb/10 15:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 07/May/10 20:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Feb/10 22:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Jsch 0.1.31 and 0.1.42.<br/>
JDK 1.6+<br/>
ant 1.8RC1<br/>
Linux Gentoo
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello !<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m using a sftp repository. Let&#39;s say there is a module called foo, revsions  1.2.3 and 1.2.4 are present.<br/>
<br/>
I add :  &lt;dependency org=&quot;org.my&quot; name=&quot;foo&quot; rev=&quot;1.2.*+*&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Resolve is unsucessful if I declare my repository as an full URL :<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;resolvers&gt;<br/>
  &lt;sftp name=&quot;public&quot; user=&quot;rep.user&quot; userPassword=&quot;rep.password&quot; &gt;<br/>
    &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;sftp://rep.host/home/ivy/repository/[organisation]/[module]/[revision]/ivys/ivy.xml&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;sftp://rep.host/home/ivy/repository/[organisation]/[module]/[revision]/[type]s/[artifact].[ext]&quot;/&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/sftp&gt;<br/>
&lt;/resolvers&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
But everything works if I declare my repository using attributes :<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;resolvers&gt;<br/>
  &lt;sftp name=&quot;public&quot; host=&quot;rep.host&quot; user=&quot;rep.user&quot; userPassword=&quot;rep.password&quot; &gt;<br/>
    &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;/home/ivy/repository/[organisation]/[module]/[revision]/ivys/ivy.xml&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;/home/ivy/repository/[organisation]/[module]/[revision]/[type]s/[artifact].[ext]&quot;/&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/sftp&gt;<br/>
&lt;/resolvers&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
In fact, the list method use the pattern as a path, and don&#39;t remove the *sftp://&lt;host&gt;* .
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
