                <tr id="issuerow12457881" rel="12457881" data-issuekey="IVY-1174" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1174" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1174">IVY-1174</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                resolved module can include configurations of evicted versions
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Willem Verstraeten
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Willem Verstraeten
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Mar/10 16:20 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Jul/12 22:41 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.0-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-1231                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Scenario:<br/>
<br/>
module_parent, with two revisions:<br/>
  1.0, which has configurations default and runtime, where default extends runtime<br/>
  1.0.3, which only has configuration default<br/>
<br/>
module_middle, which depends on module_parent:1.0<br/>
module_between, which depends on module_parent:1.0.3<br/>
<br/>
module_entry, which depends on module_middle and module_between<br/>
<br/>
When resolving module_entry, version 1.0 of module_parent will be evicted, but ivy will complain about module_parent not having a runtime configuration. Apparently, ivy has mashed the configurations from the 1.0 version (which was evicted) with those of 1.0.3, where there actually is no runtime configuration.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
