                <tr id="issuerow12459816" rel="12459816" data-issuekey="IVY-1177" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1177" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1177">IVY-1177</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Can&#39;t deal with [VERSION] version pattern from Maven
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Richard Vowles
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Richard Vowles
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Mar/10 02:52 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 07/May/10 20:13 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Mar/10 21:26 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP and Mac OS 
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you want a specific version of a resource in Maven, [VERSION] is a valid request - e.g. [1.5.8]<br/>
<br/>
I am using grape (from Groovy) and <br/>
<br/>
grape -d install org.slf4j slf4j-api [1.5.8] <br/>
<br/>
will not work. These dependencies are all over the place in our maven repo (and presumably others). I fixed it by adding to ModuleRevisionId.java <br/>
<br/>
    protected static String normalizeRevision(String asked) {<br/>
        if ( asked.startsWith( &quot;[&quot; ) &amp;&amp; asked.endsWith( &quot;]&quot; ) &amp;&amp; asked.indexOf(&#39;,&#39;) == -1 ) {<br/>
            return asked.substring(1, asked.length() - 1 );<br/>
        } else<br/>
            return asked;<br/>
    }<br/>
<br/>
and using it in the constructor:<br/>
<br/>
this.revision = revision == null ? Ivy.getWorkingRevision() : normalizeRevision(revision);
  </td>
