                <tr id="issuerow12462602" rel="12462602" data-issuekey="IVY-1187" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1187" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1187">IVY-1187</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Support Maven Relocations or ability to override dependencies when using install task
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andrew
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andrew
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Apr/10 02:06 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Apr/10 02:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant,                     Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Support relocations or the ability to override versions. e.g. xml-apis#xml-apis;2.0.2 has been relocated to xml-apis#xml-apis;1.0.b2, but Ivy fails, telling me to depend directly on the new version. Well, if I could, that would be awesome, but I can&#39;t because I have no choice about what revision a transitive dependency uses. So, I have to use the following rule instead:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;rule&gt;<br/>
	&lt;fromsystem&gt;<br/>
		&lt;src org=&quot;org.apache.xml&quot; module=&quot;xml-apis&quot;/&gt;<br/>
		&lt;dest org=&quot;$m0&quot; /&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/fromsystem&gt;<br/>
	&lt;tosystem&gt;<br/>
		&lt;src org=&quot;xml-apis&quot; module=&quot;xml-apis&quot; rev=&quot;2.0.2&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;dest org=&quot;org.apache.xml&quot; module=&quot;$m0&quot; rev=&quot;1.0.b2&quot; /&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/tosystem&gt;<br/>
&lt;/rule&gt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
Which works, despite issue #1185 not working.
  </td>
