{code}<br/>
<br/>
The size of the file that is being uploaded is: 687712714, so around 650-700MB.<br/>
<br/>
The publish task is part of a Hudson Ant build where the artefacts are published to an Artifactory repository at the end.<br/>
I have given the Job 1300MB for the max heap size.<br/>
<br/>
It seems as if the whole file is loaded into memory for the upload.
