                <tr id="issuerow12468595" rel="12468595" data-issuekey="IVY-1203" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1203" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1203">IVY-1203</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy info/extends/extendsType attribute is misspelled by XmlModuleDescriptorWriter
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jason Trump
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jason Trump
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Jul/10 00:10 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Jul/10 21:48 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/Jul/10 21:48 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The new &lt;extends&gt; element implemented for IVY-742 defines an &#39;extendType&#39; attribute.  When XmlModuleDescriptorWriter generates a new Ivy descriptor, it writes this as &#39;extendTypes&#39; (note the extra &#39;s&#39; at the end), which fails validation against ivy.xsd.  I&#39;ll try to get a failing test case + fix to attach soon.  Sorry about that :/
  </td>
