                <tr id="issuerow12469437" rel="12469437" data-issuekey="IVY-1210" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1210" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1210">IVY-1210</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Support custom TTL&#39;s for Maven snapshots.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Hans Dockter
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Hans Dockter
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Jul/10 09:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Jul/10 09:54 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      See discussion: http://old.nabble.com/Update-policy-for-Maven-snapshots-ts29152438.html<br/>
<br/>
We have solved this problem by extending the IBiblioResolver: http://github.com/gradle/gradle/blob/master/subprojects/gradle-core/src/main/groovy/org/gradle/api/internal/artifacts/ivyservice/GradleIBiblioResolver.java<br/>
<br/>
Of course you are free to integrate that into Ivy. Though, as said in the discussion above, a generic solution would be much nicer.
