                <tr id="issuerow12478882" rel="12478882" data-issuekey="IVY-1243" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1243" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1243">IVY-1243</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                UseCacheOnly is influenced by the TTL on cached metadata
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Nicolas Lalevée
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Nicolas Lalevée
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Nicolas Lalevée
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Nov/10 13:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 02/Nov/10 13:21 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Nov/10 13:21 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using useCacheOnly=true, I expect Ivy to only use the cache, so make Ivy trust the cached data.<br/>
<br/>
But it takes into account the time to live on cached metadata, and consequently reject those metadata, resulting on an unexpected failing resolve.<br/>
<br/>
I would expect Ivy to ignore the TTL configuration in the useCacheOnly mode.
  </td>
