    [javac] warning: [path] bad path element &quot;/home/archie/ivywarnbug/cache/net.sourceforge.jibx/jibx/jars/jibx-run.jar&quot;: no such file or directory<br/>
    [javac] warning: [path] bad path element &quot;/home/archie/ivywarnbug/cache/net.sourceforge.jibx/jibx/jars/jibx-bind.jar&quot;: no such file or directory<br/>
    [javac] warning: [path] bad path element &quot;/home/archie/ivywarnbug/cache/net.sourceforge.jibx/jibx/jars/xpp3.jar&quot;: no such file or directory<br/>
    [javac] warning: [path] bad path element &quot;/home/archie/ivywarnbug/cache/net.sourceforge.jibx/jibx/jars/stax-api.jar&quot;: no such file or directory<br/>
