{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
Note that the output of the {{&lt;echo&gt;}} task displays the correct path, but {{&lt;javac&gt;}} complains about non-existent files in the path that it sees, *and the paths are different!*<br/>
<br/>
Somehow the path is getting corrupted somehow when it gets passed to {{&lt;javac&gt;}}.<br/>
<br/>
Also weird is that this only happens for a few modules in Ivy Roundup. So far I&#39;ve only seen it happen with JiBX and iText.<br/>

