                <tr id="issuerow12495043" rel="12495043" data-issuekey="IVY-1257" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1257" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1257">IVY-1257</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Can&#39;t use extra attributes in ant task ivy:listmodules
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Mikhail Ponik
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Mikhail Ponik
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Jan/11 03:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 09/Jan/11 03:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      any
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m using lot of module extra attributes, for specifying debug/release, platform, architecture for modules published in ivy repository<br/>
And in deployment software i need these attributes to be specified for listing avilable versions of module with specified extra attrbiutes<br/>
but ivy:listmodules don&#39;t allow to do it.<br/>
Can this option be included, or is there another way to do it?
  </td>
