                <tr id="issuerow12497090" rel="12497090" data-issuekey="IVY-1262" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1262" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1262">IVY-1262</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                makepom child element dependency should support the type and classifier attributes.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Randy Reddekopp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Randy Reddekopp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Jan/11 20:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Feb/11 22:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Feb/11 22:12 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0-RC1,                     2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux (CentOS 5.4) x86_64<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be nice to be able to create a POM file with a dependency which has specific &lt;type&gt; and &lt;classifier&gt;.<br/>
<br/>
Example of wish:<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;ivy:makepom ivyfile=&quot;./ivy.xml&quot; pomfile=&quot;${ant.project.name}.pom&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;mapping conf=&quot;default&quot; scope=&quot;compile&quot;/&gt;<br/>
            &lt;mapping conf=&quot;runtime&quot; scope=&quot;runtime&quot;/&gt;<br/>
            &lt;dependency <br/>
                group=&quot;com.company.component&quot;<br/>
                artifact=&quot;${ant.project.name}&quot;<br/>
                version=&quot;1.0.0&quot;<br/>
                type=&quot;txt&quot;<br/>
                classifier=&quot;license&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/ivy:makepom&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Currently the type=&quot;&quot; and classifier=&quot;&quot; attributes are not available.
  </td>
