                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ibiblio resolver does not download source from local Maven repository
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Mike Pettypiece
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Mike Pettypiece
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Jan/11 17:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Nov/12 20:11 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Feb/11 21:24 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-1221                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Resolvers are as follows:<br/>
<br/>
 &lt;resolvers&gt;<br/>
    &lt;chain name=&quot;main&quot; returnFirst=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;ibiblio name=&quot;local-maven2&quot; m2compatible=&quot;true&quot; root=&quot;file:///c:/Users/&lt;username&gt;/.m2/repository&quot; /&gt;<br/>
      &lt;ibiblio name=&quot;public&quot; m2compatible=&quot;true&quot; root=&quot;http://&lt;artifactory&gt;/artifactory/libs-releases&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/chain&gt;<br/>
 &lt;/resolvers&gt;<br/>
<br/>
When artifacts are discovered using the &quot;public&quot; resolver, source (if  published) is downloaded automatically.  However when using the &quot;local-maven2&quot; resolver no source is copied.<br/>
<br/>
This appears to be the issue:<br/>
<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] 	maven-metadata not available: file:/c:/Users/&lt;username&gt;/.m2/repository/com/example/test/1.1-SNAPSHOT/maven-metadata.xml<br/>
<br/>
In this case there is no maven-metadata.xml, there is only a maven-metadata-local.xml <br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

