                <tr id="issuerow12500128" rel="12500128" data-issuekey="IVY-1271" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1271" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1271">IVY-1271</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                override and conflict missing in Child elements table
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Derek E
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Derek E
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Mar/11 23:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Apr/11 21:54 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Apr/11 21:54 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Documentation            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">7200</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">7200</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In the Reference documentation, on the &quot;dependencies&quot; page, there is a table that lists the child elements of the &#39;dependencies&#39; element along with the Cardinality of those child elements.  The &#39;override&#39; and &#39;conflict&#39; elements are missing from this table.  On the detail page for each of those elements, &#39;dependencies&#39; is listed as the Parent.<br/>
<br/>
