    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1290" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1290">IVY-1290</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy.xsd does not recognize the classifier attribute for publications
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Michael Rumpf
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Michael Rumpf
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/May/11 17:03 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/May/11 07:29 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/May/11 22:11 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The classifier attribute leads to a parser validation exception:<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;publications&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifact name=&quot;xyz&quot; ext=&quot;zip&quot; classifier=&quot;source&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifact name=&quot;xyz&quot; ext=&quot;zip&quot; classifier=&quot;doc&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifact name=&quot;xyz&quot; ext=&quot;zip&quot;/&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/publications&gt;<br/>
<br/>
This can easily be fixed by adding the following line to ivy.xsd (line 139):<br/>
<br/>
&lt;xs:attribute name=&quot;classifier&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>

  </td>
