    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1308" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1308">IVY-1308</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                makepom does not export exclusions
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Douglas Palmer
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Douglas Palmer
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jul/11 14:26 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Jul/11 21:52 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Jul/11 21:52 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-1294                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Running makepom on:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;dependency org=&quot;org.codehaus.groovy&quot; name=&quot;groovy-all&quot; rev=&quot;1.5.4&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;exclude org=&quot;xpp3&quot; module=&quot;xpp3_min&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Should give:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
      &lt;groupId&gt;org.codehaus.groovy&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
      &lt;artifactId&gt;groovy-all&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
      &lt;version&gt;1.5.4&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
      &lt;optional&gt;true&lt;/optional&gt;<br/>
      &lt;exclusions&gt;<br/>
        &lt;exclusion&gt;<br/>
          &lt;groupId&gt;xpp3&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
          &lt;artifactId&gt;xpp3_min&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/exclusion&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/exclusions&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
<br/>
But the actual result is missing the exclusion.
  </td>
