                                            <td class="description">      I have attached a patch for <br/>
<br/>
org.apache.ivy.osgi.obr.RequirementFilterTest.java<br/>
org.apache.ivy.osgi.obr.filter.RequirementFilterParser.java<br/>
<br/>
The bug can be shown when trying to parse the following filter:<br/>
---<br/>
(&amp;     (version&gt;=3.5.0)     (!(version&gt;=4.0.0))     (bundle=org.eclipse.core.runtime)    )<br/>
---<br/>
<br/>
Without the patch the bundle fragment is dropped from the filter.
