                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have attached a patch to the ivy.xml that is used by the eclipse-plugin.html tutorial as this does not work.<br/>
<br/>
In the dependency section a reference to &quot;linux&quot; is made which does not exist. <br/>
<br/>
The attached patch renames the gtk conf to linux.<br/>
<br/>
Also, the conf attribute in &lt;ivy:cachepath/&gt; does not point to anything that could ever work. So I have changed this to &quot;linux&quot; instead.
