                                            <td class="description">      Ivy gives me the cached version of a dependency when I change the pattern attribute for the artifact inside a filesystem resolver, instead of going to the new location and fetching it from there. I&#39;ve specified, on my resolver, a cache, and also I&#39;ve specified that cache with useOrigin. If I point the artifact pattern back to its original location, and update the file there, then Ivy retrieves the new version of that file.<br/>
   
