                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As a user of ivy:resolve, I would like the ability to optionally supply a url attribute instead of a file attribute so that I can be more flexible in where I source my ivy.xml files from. This would function similar to the way I can supply a URL in ivy:settings.<br/>
