                <tr id="issuerow12558636" rel="12558636" data-issuekey="IVY-1354" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1354" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1354">IVY-1354</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Dynamic version resolution incorrect under JDK7
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matt Plaumann
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matt Plaumann
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/May/12 16:30 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Oct/12 17:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      JDK7 has re-implemented {{Collections.sort()}}.  This change is causing dynamic revisions to sort incorrectly.<br/>
<br/>
Here is a simple unit test for {{LatestRevisionStrategyTest}} that shows the behaviour:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
/**<br/>
 * The sort algorithm in JDK7 changed in a way that requires comparators to be a little<br/>
 * stricter.  Running JDK7 with {@code java.util.Arrays.useLegacyMergeSort=true} reverts<br/>
 * to the previous behaviour.<br/>
 * <br/>
 * @see &lt;a href=&quot;http://bugs.sun.com/bugdatabase/view_bug.do?bug_id=6804124&quot;&gt;RFE: 6804124&lt;/a&gt;<br/>
 */<br/>
public void testJdk7Sort() {<br/>
    ArtifactInfo[] revs = toMockAI(new String[]{&quot;latest.integration&quot;, &quot;latest.milestone&quot; });<br/>
    	<br/>
    LatestRevisionStrategy latestRevisionStrategy = new LatestRevisionStrategy();<br/>
    List sorted = latestRevisionStrategy.sort( revs );<br/>
    	<br/>
    assertEquals(Arrays.asList(revs[1], revs[0]), sorted );<br/>
}<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
The {{-Djava.util.Arrays.useLegacyMergeSort=true}} VM switch reverts to the previous sort algorithm.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
