                <tr id="issuerow12609882" rel="12609882" data-issuekey="IVY-1378" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1378" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1378">IVY-1378</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy default cache path with Umlauts lets it crash.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jochen Schäfer
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jochen Schäfer
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Oct/12 07:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Oct/12 21:58 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Oct/12 09:18 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.0-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows 7 64 bit<br/>
JDK 1.7<br/>
Netbeans 7.2 with integrated Ant 1.8.3<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m trying to build the Solr 4 beta. When ivy tries to fetch the dependencies into the cache, I get the following message:<br/>
