                                            <td class="environment">      Windows 7 x64 Ultimate Edition with russian locale<br/>
JVM 1.7.07 x64<br/>
Ant - latest stable version (version number not important)<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      If username in system, where I was executing Apache Ivy, contains Russian symbols (if encoding different from ASCII) - Ivy not working with default cache location, which located under my %USER_HOME%/.ivy2 directory, and dependences couldn&#39;t  be resolved.<br/>
Ex.:<br/>
successful cache path (if create it by hand) -  C:\cache\.ivy2\<br/>
error (if using default cache location) - C:\Users\Евгений\.ivy2\<br/>
Please, fix this issue ASAP, because this is critical for many users.<br/>
Thanks in advance.
  </td>
