                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I had written a Guide focused mainly on beginners who would like to get started with Ivy without much difficulty. This step by step guide helps beginners in understanding basic Ivy concepts/tasks and use them straight away in their projects either through Ant build or in Eclipse IDE. <br/>
<br/>
Guide is hosted at http://olmex.blogspot.in/2012/04/ivy-beginners-guide.html as downloadable PDF. It has got fairly good response from users in last 6 months with about 3000 downloads. At present, on an average, it is downloaded 50 times per week. <br/>
<br/>
As this guide helps new users to understand Ivy concepts/task in easy steps, I would be happy if it is added to Ivy Documentation -&gt; Tutorial -&gt; More Examples page. <br/>
<br/>
I have edited More example page and added the link as detailed in Get Involved page. <br/>
<br/>
The patch is attached herewith.
