                                            <td class="description">      Ivy should be able to resolve modules defined in a pom like that:<br/>
&lt;modules&gt;<br/>
        &lt;module&gt;unitils-core&lt;/module&gt;<br/>
        &lt;module&gt;unitils-testng&lt;/module&gt;<br/>
        &lt;module&gt;unitils-database&lt;/module&gt;<br/>
&lt;/modules&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Maybe with the use of a own configuration as discussed here: http://osdir.com/ml/apache.incubator.ivy.user/2008-03/msg00157.html<br/>
<br/>
Another example is Unitils (see https://unitils.svn.sourceforge.net/svnroot/unitils/trunk/pom.xml)
