                <tr id="issuerow12624265" rel="12624265" data-issuekey="IVY-1396" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1396" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1396">IVY-1396</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy generating wrong revision in URL for sample Maven artifact
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Nick Spacek
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Nick Spacek
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Dec/12 12:38 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/Dec/12 23:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Dec/12 23:18 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.0-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m having some troubles with Ivy resolving the wrong latest.integration for a Maven artifact. It is reading the Maven metadata (apparently)and determining that there is a 0.0.3-SNAPSHOT version. Strangely, it then attempts to retrieve a POM that is using both the 0.0.3-SNAPSHOT version from the metadata and a 0.0.1-SNAPSHOT version that it could have only discovered using the metadata for that particular version, as you will see below. As far as I can tell, the Maven metadata is fine.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve put together a sample. A simple, empty Maven artifact, and an Ivy build that resolves it.<br/>
<br/>
I deployed three version of Maven artifact at 0.0.1-SNAPSHOT. Each time I asked Ivy to resolve, it was successful. When I updated the version to 0.0.2-SNAPSHOT, it began mixing the URLs.
  </td>
