                <tr id="issuerow12634631" rel="12634631" data-issuekey="IVY-1411" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1411" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1411">IVY-1411</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make the progress bar a bit more reasonable
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Martin Todorov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Martin Todorov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Feb/13 15:37 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Apr/13 15:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-1197                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      At the moment, the progress bar displays a dot for each (I am guessing the number here, for the sake of the example) 10 kb. This does not make sense. I have a very large artifact which is &gt; 1.5 GB. Displaying the dots takes more time, than it takes to actually download the file. I think that it would be much cooler (and more sensible) to make the progress bar show something like 10-20 dots... Something more reasonable than it is right now. Nobody needs to have logs full of dots.<br/>
<br/>
I think this should be a trivial fix.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks!
  </td>
