</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                publication date provided in bad format - random failures - thread safety parsing dates
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
