                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have an explicit dependency, and two transitive dependencies to the same log4j package but all at different versions.<br/>
<br/>
I have a runtime conf and a test conf that extends the runtime conf.<br/>
<br/>
I am trying to exclude the log4j dependency in the runtime conf. When I do so, I get &quot;impossible to get artifacts when data has not been loaded&quot;.<br/>
<br/>
If I do any of the following, the error disappears:<br/>
 * Remove the test conf<br/>
 * Remove any of the explicit dependencies<br/>
 * Remove the log4j exclusion<br/>
 * Exclude log4j from all configurations
