                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-1460                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      At present, Ivy is unable to leverage agent support to access SSH keys unlocked and stored in memory. For sites using encrypted RSA keys, requiring additional user intervention when those keys are already decrypted and stored in non-pageable memory is unfortunate.<br/>
<br/>
This support is available using companion libraries from the author of Jsch; I have a patch adding it.
