                                            <td class="description">      Add a new ant task to see dependency updates.<br/>
<br/>
The task try to resolve all libs with a configurable revision (latest.integration) by default and log :<br/>
  * dependency updates <br/>
  * new transitive dependencies<br/>
  * missing transitive dependencies (in case you upgrade a dependency and one of it&#39;s dependency disappear you rely on a new version)<br/>
<br/>
The task  will be a post resolve task [1], so all commons attributes would be available including inline=&quot;true&quot;.<br/>
<br/>

