                <tr id="issuerow12658060" rel="12658060" data-issuekey="IVY-1427" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1427" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1427">IVY-1427</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                buildlist has wrong order with module inheritance
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Marcin Wisnicki
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Marcin Wisnicki
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Jul/13 17:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Jul/13 18:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.0,                     2.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-1345                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Attached example has 3 projects:<br/>
<br/>
 * proj1 extends proj3 needs proj2<br/>
 * proj2 extends proj3<br/>
 * proj3<br/>
<br/>
If you invoke ant in main directory you will see buildlist as:<br/>
<br/>
 # proj2<br/>
 # proj1<br/>
 # proj3<br/>
<br/>
Which is wrong since both proj1 and proj2 extend proj3 and therefore it should be first in order.<br/>
<br/>
I have a multi-module project with staging repository and when module is being published before it&#39;s parent, ivy fails with exception &quot;bad ivy file in cache&quot;.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
