</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Right now, the default overwriteMode during retrieve is &#39;newer&#39;.<br/>
This is causing problems for us now (incorrect artifacts being loaded).<br/>
<br/>
Since we don&#39;t use ant, but commandline access to Ivy, there&#39;s no way for us to fix this issue.<br/>
It would be great to either:<br/>
- add a commandline option to manage overwriteMode<br/>
- add overwriteMode to ivysettings.xml, so it can be overridden there
  </td>
