                                            <td class="description">      (Remark: I already posted this on dev mailing list, but I think it&#39;s better to add an issue)<br/>
<br/>
When using Ivy&#39;s OSGi support with an ivy.xml (snippet) like<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&quot;2.2&quot; xmlns:o=&quot;http://ant.apache.org/ivy/osgi&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;info organisation=&quot;meta-level&quot; module=&quot;osgi-parent&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;extends organisation=&quot;bundle&quot;   module=&quot;mymodule&quot;<br/>
          revision=&quot;1.0.0.qualifier&quot;<br/>
          location=&quot;META-INF/MANIFEST.MF&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/info&gt;<br/>
....<br/>
<br/>
then after calling e.g. ant task ivy:resolve on Windows the following error can be seen on console output:<br/>
<br/>
