                                            <td class="description">      Currently when declaring dependencies, it is only possible to set:<br/>
rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot;<br/>
or<br/>
rev=&quot;4.0.+&quot;<br/>
<br/>
What would be important in our use case would be able to consider both, along the lines of:<br/>
rev=&quot;4.0.+&quot; status=&quot;integration&quot;<br/>
<br/>
From the documentation it looks like this is not currently supported.<br/>
<br/>
I apologize if this is a duplicate, but I could not find one matching this after spending some time with the search function.
