                                            <td class="description">      Trace is:<br/>
java.lang.NullPointerException: charsetName<br/>
  at java.io.InputStreamReader.&lt;init&gt;(Unknown Source)<br/>
  at org.apache.ivy.util.url.ApacheURLLister.retrieveListing(ApacheURLLister.java:113)<br/>
  at org.apache.ivy.util.url.ApacheURLLister.listAll(ApacheURLLister.java:57)<br/>
