                                            <td class="description">      IvyArtifactReport fails to report artifacts when extra attributes are used. For example with an ivy-module having dependency:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
  &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
    &lt;dependency org=&quot;x&quot;<br/>
                name=&quot;native&quot;<br/>
                rev=&quot;1.0.0&quot;<br/>
                x:color=&quot;blue&quot;/&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
the generated report doesn&#39;t show artifacts.
