                                            <td class="environment">      Eclipse Kepler SR2, fresh install<br/>
Ant 1.9.3<br/>
IvyDE 2.2.0 final, fresh install<br/>
Ivy 2.3, manually installed (see description)<br/>
Ivy 2.4 RC1, installed as part of IvyDE
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      One of my colleagues updated eclipse recently, which pulled in an Ivy 2.4 jar into `$ECLIPSE/plugins`. Thereafter, resolving a project in eclipse pops up this error:<br/>
<br/>
{{The resolve job of ivy.xml\[*] in accountManagement has unexpectedly stopped}}<br/>
{{com/jcraft/jsch/agentproxy/AgentProxyException}}<br/>
<br/>
Removing the ivy 2.4 jar from the eclipse plugin folder and replacing it with an ivy 2.3 jar fixed our problems.
  </td>
