                                            <td class="environment">      java version &quot;1.7.0_55&quot;<br/>
Java(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build 1.7.0_55-b13)<br/>
Java HotSpot(TM) 64-Bit Server VM (build 24.55-b03, mixed mode)<br/>
OS = Windows 7 6.1 Service Pack 1 amd64-64<br/>
JAVA_HOME = C:\Program Files\Java\jdk1.7.0_55<br/>
ant.version = Apache Ant(TM) version 1.9.3 compiled on December 23 2013<br/>
ant.home = C:\Java\apache-ant-1.9.3<br/>
ANT_OPTS = -XX:MaxPermSize=256m -Xmx2048m 
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Right now, I can say:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;dependency org=&quot;org.jboss.teiid.connectors&quot; name=&quot;connector-accumulo&quot; conf=&quot;ais.dist&quot; rev=&quot;${teiid.version}&quot; transitive=&quot;false&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;artifact name=&quot;connector-accumulo&quot; maven:classifier=&quot;lib&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
But this does not work:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;dependency org=&quot;org.jboss.teiid.connectors&quot; name=&quot;connector-accumulo&quot; conf=&quot;ais.dist&quot; rev=&quot;${teiid.version}&quot; transitive=&quot;false&quot; maven:classifier=&quot;lib&quot; /&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
which would be simpler.<br/>
<br/>

