  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I try to load _any_ artifact from<br/>
<br/>
http://download.eclipse.org/rt/rap/2.3/<br/>
<br/>
I get 		<br/>
<br/>
:: bundle#org.eclipse.osgi;3.10+: java.lang.NullPointerException at org.apache.ivy.osgi.p2.P2MetadataParser.namespace2Type(P2MetadataParser.java:338)<br/>
