                <tr id="issuerow12739304" rel="12739304" data-issuekey="IVY-1486" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1486" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1486">IVY-1486</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Order-dependent resolution: exclude not respected
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Antoine Levy-Lambert
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            David Turner
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            David Turner
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Sep/14 02:13 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Sep/16 21:58 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        master            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">2</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      To repro, create an  ivy.xml which looks like this (see the attached one for an real-world example that you can test out):<br/>
dependency A 1.1<br/>
dependency X 1.2<br/>
  exclude Y<br/>
-------<br/>
dependency A 1.1&#39;s depends on:<br/>
   dependency X 1.1<br/>
<br/>
Dependency X 1.1&#39;s depends on:<br/>
  dependency Y 1.1<br/>
<br/>
Dependency X 1.2&#39;s depends on:<br/>
  dependency Y 1.2<br/>
------------------------------<br/>
In this case, we will get Y 1.2.  But if we swap the order of the dependencies in our ivy.xml, we&#39;ll get Y 1.1.  I think 1.1 is correct, because we&#39;ve excluded 1.2. 
  </td>
