                <tr id="issuerow12745534" rel="12745534" data-issuekey="IVY-1488" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1488" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1488">IVY-1488</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Apache IVY to Maven : Bug Excluding Artifacts?
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Iker
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Iker
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Oct/14 16:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Dec/16 23:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Dec/16 23:38 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">3600</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I think there is a bug translating from ivy to maven &quot;makepom&quot; when the excursion set of artifacts:<br/>
<br/>
For example, this IVY xml :<br/>
<br/>
&lt;dependency org=&quot;org.apache.xmlgraphics&quot; name=&quot;fop&quot; rev=&quot;1.0&quot; transitive=&quot;true&quot; conf=&quot;compile-&gt;master&quot;&gt;     <br/>
            &lt;exclude org=&quot;org.apache.xmlgraphics&quot; name=&quot;batik-awt-util&quot;  /&gt;     <br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
Is translated this way to POM<br/>
<br/>
&lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
&lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.xmlgraphics&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
&lt;artifactId&gt;fop&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
&lt;version&gt;1.0&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
&lt;scope&gt;compile&lt;/scope&gt;<br/>
&lt;exclusions&gt;<br/>
  &lt;exclusion&gt;<br/>
   &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.xmlgraphics&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
   &lt;artifactId&gt;*&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/exclusion&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/exclusions&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
As seen, rather than exclude the artifact &quot;batik-awt-util&quot; , all artifacts (*) are excluded !!!!!!
  </td>
