                <tr id="issuerow12764471" rel="12764471" data-issuekey="IVY-1505" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1505" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1505">IVY-1505</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy can not correctly resolve hbase-client pom
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Talat UYARER
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Talat UYARER
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Jan/15 23:29 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Jan/15 19:59 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
When I added hbase-client as a dependecy like as:<br/>
{panel}<br/>
 &lt;dependency org=&quot;org.apache.hbase&quot; name=&quot;hbase-client&quot; rev=&quot;0.98.8-hadoop2&quot; conf=&quot;*-&gt;default&quot;&gt;<br/>
{panel}<br/>
<br/>
Ivy does not correctly map some dependencies of hbase-client. hbase-common and hbase-annotation should be in compile scope. In Ivy resolve xml they look like:<br/>
{panel:title= ~/.ivy2/cache/org.apache.hbase/hbase-client/ivy-0.98.8-hadoop2.xml}<br/>
                &lt;dependency org=&quot;org.apache.hbase&quot; name=&quot;hbase-annotations&quot; rev=&quot;0.98.8-hadoop2&quot; force=&quot;true&quot; conf=&quot;test-&gt;runtime(*),master(*)&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                &lt;dependency org=&quot;org.apache.hbase&quot; name=&quot;hbase-annotations&quot; rev=&quot;0.98.8-hadoop2&quot; force=&quot;true&quot; conf=&quot;test-&gt;runtime(*),master(*)&quot;&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;artifact name=&quot;hbase-annotations&quot; type=&quot;test-jar&quot; ext=&quot;jar&quot; conf=&quot;&quot; m:classifier=&quot;tests&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
                &lt;dependency org=&quot;org.apache.hbase&quot; name=&quot;hbase-common&quot; rev=&quot;0.98.8-hadoop2&quot; force=&quot;true&quot; conf=&quot;test-&gt;runtime(*),master(*)&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                &lt;dependency org=&quot;org.apache.hbase&quot; name=&quot;hbase-common&quot; rev=&quot;0.98.8-hadoop2&quot; force=&quot;true&quot; conf=&quot;test-&gt;runtime(*),master(*)&quot;&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;artifact name=&quot;hbase-common&quot; type=&quot;test-jar&quot; ext=&quot;jar&quot; conf=&quot;&quot; m:classifier=&quot;tests&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
{panel}<br/>
I think this a bug. Can you help me how can i fix it ?
  </td>
