                <tr id="issuerow12764643" rel="12764643" data-issuekey="IVY-1506" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1506" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1506">IVY-1506</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add support for password protected Maven repositories in ibiblio resolver
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andre-John Mas
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andre-John Mas
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Jan/15 19:20 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Jun/17 12:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 01/Jun/17 12:38 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      There doesn&#39;t appear to be a way to access repositories that are protected by username/password.<br/>
<br/>
In the case I encountered, the repository had public access, but when it is provided with an authenticated user, then an extended set of artifacts is made available. Not being able to specify the username/password via the ivy-settings meant I was only able to access the public artefacts.<br/>
<br/>
The suggestion is to use a similar approach to the &#39;ssh&#39; resolver and add support for username/password elements.<br/>

  </td>
