                <tr id="issuerow12823712" rel="12823712" data-issuekey="IVY-1519" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1519" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1519">IVY-1519</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                POM: If no dependency version is given it should be determined from the parent version
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sebastian Schuberth
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sebastian Schuberth
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Apr/15 10:25 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/15 10:25 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.4.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When e.g. asm-commons is transitively retrieved (in my case as part of Robolectric), Ivy fails to determine the correct version of asm-tree which asm-commons depends on. Looking at asm-common&#39;s POM [1]:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;project&gt;<br/>
  &lt;modelVersion&gt;4.0.0&lt;/modelVersion&gt;<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;parent&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifactId&gt;asm-parent&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;groupId&gt;org.ow2.asm&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;version&gt;5.0.1&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/parent&gt;<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;name&gt;ASM Commons&lt;/name&gt;<br/>
  &lt;artifactId&gt;asm-commons&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
  &lt;packaging&gt;jar&lt;/packaging&gt;<br/>
  <br/>
  &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
    &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
      &lt;artifactId&gt;asm-tree&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
      &lt;groupId&gt;org.ow2.asm&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;/project&gt;<br/>
<br/>
So the asm-tree does not have a &quot;&lt;version&gt;&quot; tag, but the &quot;&lt;parent&gt;&quot; tag has. In that case Ivy should determine the version from the parent tag instead of hard-coding it do &quot;working&quot;.<br/>
<br/>
[1] https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/ow2/asm/asm-commons/5.0.1/asm-commons-5.0.1.pom
  </td>
