                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve been exploring the Ant ivy:makepom task in more detail and found that I can transfer the module, organisation and homepage from the original Ivy file but not the description.  The docs for makepom say that I can set property ivy.pom.description or use a description element.  But using either of these does not present me with a straightforward means of transferring the description from the resolved Ivy file.
