                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The PomModuleDescriptorParser transfers all extra info from the parent descriptor without considering the possibility that there may be some extra attribute namespaces used in the extra info.  If there is, the descriptor will fail to parse when it&#39;s next read.<br/>
<br/>
When it transfers the extra info, it should also transfer extra attribute namespaces.
