                <tr id="issuerow12902379" rel="12902379" data-issuekey="IVY-1535" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1535" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1535">IVY-1535</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy.findModule() does not invalidate artifacts
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Ilya
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Ilya
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Oct/15 08:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Oct/15 08:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have Java code, that at one point calls {{Ivy.findModule()}}. If there are new ivys and artifacts for this module in repository, then {{Ivy.findModule()}} updates ivys, but does not delete artifacts. Subsequent resolutions then return cached new ivys and outdated artifacts. That poses a problem.<br/>
<br/>
The proposed solution is to use {{changing=true}} in synthetic {{DependencyDescriptor}} created by {{ResolveEngine.findModule()}}.
  </td>
