                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A 3rd party library with circular dependencies causes an infinite loop displaying the dependency tree.  The code needs to use a hashmap or hashset to track what has been displayed in a given tree branch and bail when it encounters a node previously occurring in the branch.<br/>
<br/>
This dependency is circular, and can be used for testing:<br/>
<br/>
org.apache.xmlgraphics#batik-bridge;1.7<br/>

