                                            <td class="description">      resolve fails when using the ant-contrib for task in parallel.<br/>
The line that fails is this:<br/>
        &lt;ivy:resolve file=&quot;${common.t24ivy.xml}&quot; haltonfailure=&quot;${haltonfailure}&quot; revision=&quot;1.0.0&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
I fixed this locally by making the parseDescriptor method in XmlModuleDescriptorParser synchronized.<br/>
<br/>
The error output is as below:<br/>
