                                            <td class="description">      Despite the efforts of:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
commit 09b1a632c17b34650d2bcf748be14690c9882e52<br/>
Author: Nicolas Lalevée &lt;nicolas.lalevee@hibnet.org&gt;<br/>
Date:   Mon Sep 7 01:28:55 2015 +0200<br/>
<br/>
    Seems there is one last Maven 1 repo available<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
I now see 6 tests failing in {{IBiblioResolverTest}} and {{URLResolverTest}}, and http://mirrors.ibiblio.org/maven/ is now empty.  Perhaps it was mirroring central.  Will either need local repo for maven1 tests, or retire tests.  I&#39;ve not seen a single Maven1 use in my work in more than 5 years, so perhaps it is time ...
