                <tr id="issuerow13025613" rel="13025613" data-issuekey="IVY-1551" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1551" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1551">IVY-1551</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy incorrectly enforces improper version of a dependency in case of usage of &lt;dependencyManagement&gt;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Pavel S.
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Pavel S.
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Dec/16 12:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Dec/16 04:25 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      sbt 0.13.13
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have sbt project, which refers a dependency from a hosted Maven repository.<br/>
<br/>
In the parent pom of the dependency there is {{dependencyManagement}} and {{dependencies}} sections declared:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
    &lt;dependencyManagement&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
            &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
                &lt;groupId&gt;org.springframework.cloud&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;artifactId&gt;spring-cloud-starter-parent&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;version&gt;Angel.SR4&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                &lt;type&gt;pom&lt;/type&gt;<br/>
                &lt;scope&gt;import&lt;/scope&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
            &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
                &lt;groupId&gt;org.projectlombok&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;artifactId&gt;lombok&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;version&gt;1.14.8&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
// ...<br/>
        &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/dependencyManagement&gt;<br/>
<br/>
   &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
            &lt;groupId&gt;org.projectlombok&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifactId&gt;lombok&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
         &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
I have a subproject with the pom like so:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;project xmlns=&quot;http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0&quot;<br/>
         xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;<br/>
         xsi:schemaLocation=&quot;http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0 http://maven.apache.org/xsd/maven-4.0.0.xsd&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;parent&gt;<br/>
        &lt;artifactId&gt;starter-kafka&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;groupId&gt;com.test.parent&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;version&gt;2.0.0-SNAPSHOT&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/parent&gt;<br/>
    &lt;modelVersion&gt;4.0.0&lt;/modelVersion&gt;<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;artifactId&gt;starter-kafka-core&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
            &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.kafka&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifactId&gt;kafka-clients&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
            &lt;groupId&gt;org.springframework.hateoas&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifactId&gt;spring-hateoas&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
&lt;/project&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
When I&#39;m referencing my artifact {{starter-kafka}} from a maven project lombok dependency version is set to 0.14.8 as it declared in the {{dependencyManagement}} section of the parent pom of my dependency.<br/>
<br/>
When I&#39;m referencing {{starter-kafka}} from a sbt project lombok dependency version is almost always set to 0.12.6, as it declared in spring&#39;s parent pom {{dependencyManagement}} section (but sometimes it may be set to a proper value).<br/>
<br/>
In case I set lombok version explicitly in both of my parent pom everything works fine for both Maven and sbt:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
   &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
            &lt;groupId&gt;org.projectlombok&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifactId&gt;lombok&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
            &lt;version&gt;1.14.8&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
         &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Also please note that effective pom is the same in both the cases. So the problem is how Ivy interprets the pom.
  </td>
